    "content": "Action: Check Redis connection pool saturation on node cluster `SKU-PROD-CLUSTER-A4`. - `ERR-901-DATABASE-FAILOVER`: Primary PostgreSQL node disconnected. Automatic read-replica promotion initiated. Action: Verify split-brain prevention lock in Consul.",
