    "parent_id": "29241a29-7d91-40b8-ac8b-c8c9b5a5ce37",
    "content": "Access is restricted strictly to C-Suite Officers (CEO, CFO, CTO) and Members of the Board of Directors. ## 2.",
    "chunk_type": "child",
    "chunk_index": 1,
    "metadata": {
      "doc_id": "291f3caa-92c7-4b75-a431-2e5f3a30bc0e",
