    "parent_id": "29241a29-7d91-40b8-ac8b-c8c9b5a5ce37",
    "content": "- Maximum outperformance (125%+ ARR target): 200% target payout cap. ## 3.",
    "chunk_type": "child",
    "chunk_index": 3,
    "metadata": {
      "doc_id": "291f3caa-92c7-4b75-a431-2e5f3a30bc0e",
